<workflow>
Follow this 4-step execution model for every task:

1. EXPLORE & DIAGNOSE
   - Read the relevant codebase sections, configuration files, and documentation before editing.

2. PLAN
   - For complex tasks (touching >2 files or involving database schema/API migrations), summarize your proposed solution step-by-step before making file edits.
   - Identify edge cases, compatibility issues, and risk areas before writing code.

3. EXECUTE
   - Make precise, incremental changes.
   - Use parallel tool calls when fetching independent data or running concurrent, non-conflicting reads/searches.
   - Ensure proper syntax, handling for null/undefined values, and robust error boundaries.
